{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18859","headline":"聚蚊谣 · 刘禹锡","name":"聚蚊谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沈沈夏夜兰堂开，飞蚊伺暗声如雷。\n嘈然歘起初骇听，殷殷若自南山来。\n喧腾鼓舞喜昏黑，昧者不分听者惑。\n露花滴沥月上天，利觜迎人着不得。\n我躯七尺尔如芒，我孤尔衆能我伤。\n天生有时不可遏，爲尔设幄潜匡牀。\n清商一来秋日晓，羞尔微形饲丹鸟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18859.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18859","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"管遗瑞"}